### 2. Commercial End-User License Agreement (Schemap CLI & Team Services)
The compiled Schemap CLI binaries, continuous sync daemon, MCP protocol runtime,
CI/CD Quality Gate engine, and Enterprise Cloudflare Control Plane services are licensed
commercially for developer and organizational use.

* **Free Tier**: Free for local evaluation and open-source projects on databases up to 100 tables.
* **Pro Tier**: Individual developer license for unlimited local tables.
* **Team Tier**: Organization seat license authorizing automated CI/CD pipeline execution, breaking mutation gating, automated PII sanitization, and team device concurrency.
* **Enterprise Tier**: Custom organization licensing including air-gapped deployments, custom compliance SLAs, and dedicated priority support.

For commercial licensing inquiries: licensing@schemap.dev
Website: https://schemap.dev
